Autosave enabled: selection, accepted turns, rewind and quit save canonical state.
Demo harbour-v1: five prerecorded turns; your choices do not alter the recorded fiction. Exhaustion never switches to a live backend.
Brief: enter a nonblank adventure idea. /help lists commands.
Commands: /help /quit /cancel /retry /inspect /diagnostics /save /save-copy /list [AFTER_ID]
/load SAVE_ID --limits current|original [--backup]; /rewind N
Outline: empty line accepts; /edit replaces title and description.
Play: empty line continues; /action N selects a one-based action; /event requests an interesting event. Ordinary numbers are player text. // escapes an initial slash.
Ctrl-C cancels generation; idle Ctrl-C and EOF exit. Selection, accepted turns and rewind autosave. During storage, help, inspection, diagnostics and quit remain available.
